{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And he bowed down to the ground seven times.</b> He could have said three times, in the manner of what is written concerning David and Jonathan (I Samuel 20:41): ״ויפול לאפיו ארצה וישתחו שלש פעמים״ — 'and he fell on his face to the ground and bowed three times.' But he mentioned seven to teach you (Proverbs 24:16): ״כי שבע יפול צדיק וקם״ — 'for a righteous man falls seven times and rises.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:17:16.688731464Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}